and begin your exploration at night by walking along Thonglor Street.'),(121,9,'_muu_happenings_title','Happenings.'),(122,9,'_muu_happenings_heading','– KODAWARI TSUKIJI, AN IMMERSIVE FISH MARKET EXPERIENCE'),(123,9,'_muu_happenings_text','Focusing on a short-circuit approach and the quality of its products, the friendly restaurant follows the Japanese philosophy of kodawari: to pursue perfection.'),(124,9,'_muu_newsletter_heading','STAY TUNE - SUBSCRIBE TO OUR NEWSLETTER'),(125,9,'_muu_reservation_phone','+66 (0) 2 090 9000'),(126,9,'_muu_reservation_email','rsvn.akt8@theakyra.com'),(127,9,'_muu_hotel_address','88/333 Sukhumvit 55, North Klongton, Wattana District, Bangkok 10110'),(130,9,'_elementor_data','[{\"id\":\"150460d\",\"elType\":\"e-flexbox\",\"settings\":{\"classes\":{\"$$type\":\"classes\",\"value\":[\"e-c3ac13b\"]}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"b338cf1\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"shortcode\":\"[muu_nav_lefttab]\\n\\n[muu_orange_shape\\n    target=\\\".muu-hero-host\\\"\\n    left=\\\"20%\\\"\\n    top=\\\"12%\\\"\\n    width=\\\"28%\\\"\\n    rotate=\\\"0\\\"\\n    flip_x=\\\"true\\\"\\n    color=\\\"#ff6a00\\\"\\n]\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"shortcode\"},{\"id\":\"1b96b1a\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":true},\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":true},\"background_overlay_background\":\"classic\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"efd11cc\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost:8080\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/08\\/hero.png\",\"id\":58,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"image_size\":\"full\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false,\"styles\":{\"e-c3ac13b\":{\"id\":\"e-c3ac13b\",\"label\":\"local\",\"type\":\"class\",\"variants\":[{\"meta\":{