w, http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/hero-768x384.png 768w, http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/hero-1536x768.png 1536w\" alt=\"\"/>','Homepage - Hero','','publish','closed','closed','','homepage-hero','','','2026-08-27 07:57:48','2026-08-27 07:57:48','',0,'http://localhost:8080/?elementor_library=homepage-hero',0,'elementor_library','',0),(147,1,'2026-08-27 10:59:52','2026-08-27 10:59:52','<h2>Discovery.</h2>															<img src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/discovery-rsichn2o07wedswsluad5r35sz32tyjq2l7r5wuqn2.jpg\" title=\"discovery\" alt=\"discovery\" loading=\"lazy\" />																<h2>muu</h2>					<h2>– LOREM IPSUM DOLOR <br>SIT AMET, CONSECTETUR <br>ADIPISCING ELIT. PELLE<br>NTESQUE VESTIBULUM <br>LIBERO LOREM, EGET <br>CURSUS TORTOR.</h2>		&nbsp;Muu is a new, unpretentious yet luxurious hotel brand that is built around a belief that happiness comes from being oneself. Through dynamic, artistic spaces that live and breathe with the whims of its guests, muu is personable, ever-changing and never boring.','Homepage - Discovery.','','publish','closed','closed','','homepage-discovery','','','2026-08-27 10:59:52','2026-08-27 10:59:52','',0,'http://localhost:8080/?elementor_library=homepage-discovery',0,'elementor_library','',0),(154,1,'2026-08-27 11:08:33','2026-08-27 11:08:33','<h2>FOOD</h2>															<img width=\"1080\" height=\"1440\" src=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/ee69b403-95b8-4edf-8524-5bf8783e1447.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/ee69b403-95b8-4edf-8524-5bf8783e1447.png 1080w, http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/ee69b403-95b8-4edf-8524-5bf8783e1447-225x300.png 225w, http://localhost:8080/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/ee69b403-95b8-4edf-8524-5bf8783e1447-768x1024.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1080px) 100vw, 1080px\" />																<h2>Happenings.</h2>					<h2>– KODAWARI TSUKIJI,<br>AN IMMERSIVE FISH<br>MARKET EXPERIENCE</h2>		<p>Focusing on a short-circuit approach and the quality of its products, the friendly restaurant follows the Japanese philosophy of kodawari, to pursue perfection, to the letter.</p><p>The menu, hung from a clothes line, offers unusual dishes that showcase seafood. Five traditionally made ramen dishes are available with different toppings. In contrast to the typical starters like edamame and gyoza, the desserts surprise the taste buds. Scallop rice pudding, miso ice cream with crunchy pumpkin seeds… The flavour combinations are a success. As the food is prepared in an open kitchen, diners can watch the chefs at work, whether they are seated around a large raw-wood table or at the bar.</p>			<h2>MORE</h2>					<h2>←</h2>					<h2>01 / 02</h2>					<h2>→</h2>','Homepage - Happenings.','','publish','closed','closed','','homepage-happenings','','','2026-08-27 11:08:34','2026-08-27 11:08:34','',0,'http://localhost:8080/?elementor_library=homepage-happenings',0,'elementor_library','',0),(163,1,'2026-08-27 11:40:57','2026-08-27 11:40:57','<h2>STAY TUNE - SUBSCRIBE TO OUR NEWSLETTER</h2>					\n<form action=\"#\" method=\"post\" style=\"\ndisplay:flex;align-items:stretch;width:100%;border-bottom:2px solid rgba(255,255,255,.85);\nfont-family:\'HK Grotesk\',Arial,sans-serif;\">\n  <label for=\"muu-newsletter-email\" style=\"position:absolute;left:-9999px;\">Email</label>\n  <input id=\"muu-newsletter-email\" type=\"email\" name=\"email\" placeholder=\"Email\" style=\"\n  flex:1;min-width:0;border:0;background:transparent;color:#fff;outline:0;\n  padding:1rem 0;font:400 clamp(1rem,1.15vw,1.35rem)/1.2 \'HK Grotesk\',Arial,sans-serif;\">\n  <button type=\"submit\" style=\"\n  width:clamp(6rem,7.5vw,8rem);min-height:clamp(4.5rem,5.5vw,6rem);\n  border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.9);border-bottom:0;background:transparent;\n  color:#fe5000;font:700 clamp(.9rem,1vw,1.15rem)/1 \'HK Grotesk\',Arial,sans-serif;\n  letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;cursor:pointer;\">S